  "steps": [
    "To a blender add 60g oats, 1 banana (120g), 2 dates, 1 tbsp honey, 80g Greek yogurt (High protein), 1 cup water (150ml)",
    "Pour the mixture in a pan on medium heat, Add jammy blue berries to one pancake and 8g dark chocolate to the other, after 2 min bring the flame to low and cover, 10 min later flip the pan cakes and let it cook for another 2 min, Put a tsp of peanut butter on each pancake and it’s ready to serve."
